WEBVTT

01:28.610 --> 01:32.370
Our Secret
EP10

01:35.480 --> 01:36.330
Hurry up and eat.

01:36.650 --> 01:38.120
I'll take you home after meal.

01:40.520 --> 01:42.090
I don't wanna go back.

01:44.760 --> 01:46.370
Could you let me stay here for one night.

01:48.010 --> 01:49.120
You wish.

01:50.439 --> 01:51.650
You must go home, like it or not.

01:55.200 --> 01:56.200
You're so petty.

02:12.250 --> 02:13.810
Grown up already, ha!

02:14.120 --> 02:15.480
able to run away from home?

02:24.560 --> 02:25.320
Hello.

02:26.890 --> 02:28.120
I

02:28.120 --> 02:29.650
came across Ding Xian down the road.

02:29.840 --> 02:31.600
so I took her to dinner.

02:32.250 --> 02:33.730
Then I walked her home.

02:34.009 --> 02:35.759
Thank you, Siyue.

02:36.120 --> 02:38.040
You're welcome.

02:39.170 --> 02:40.009
Siyue

02:40.250 --> 02:42.840
Xianxian is a bit strange recently.

02:43.320 --> 02:44.759
By the way,

02:44.960 --> 02:46.290
Does Xianxian

02:46.600 --> 02:49.810
have a boyfriend at school?

02:52.320 --> 02:54.090
She didn't mention anything alike to me.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.320
Maybe it's all in my head.

02:58.290 --> 02:59.530
Xianxian has been

03:00.400 --> 03:01.530
particularly rebellious recently.

03:01.840 --> 03:03.480
She keeps a lot of things from me.

03:03.650 --> 03:04.760
I can't help asking.

03:07.760 --> 03:10.400
But I think Ding Xian is quite obedient.

03:10.650 --> 03:11.560
So

03:12.090 --> 03:13.480
you don't have to worry too much.

03:14.200 --> 03:16.040
Please, don't let me keep you.

03:16.290 --> 03:17.170
Take care.

03:17.370 --> 03:18.680
Thank you for sending Xianxian back.

03:18.930 --> 03:19.730
You're welcome.

03:21.680 --> 03:23.170
Goodbye.

03:40.930 --> 03:41.890
Tell me.

03:42.290 --> 03:44.120
What have you done to my daughter?

03:45.170 --> 03:46.370
I'm worried about her.

03:47.560 --> 03:48.930
So I read her diary.

03:50.040 --> 03:51.759
But I didn't say anything.

03:52.009 --> 03:53.400
You just know how to conceal her faults.

03:53.600 --> 03:54.840
Conceal her faults?

03:55.040 --> 03:56.530
You infringed her privacy.

03:56.680 --> 03:57.320
Do you know that?

03:57.480 --> 03:58.530
You can't do this.

03:59.759 --> 04:01.320
Better go cheer her up.

04:01.480 --> 04:03.170
No.

04:03.370 --> 04:04.730
I'm still angry.

04:05.530 --> 04:06.010
You...

04:07.320 --> 04:08.650
You're so stubborn.

04:37.089 --> 04:38.370
Someone says that

04:39.650 --> 04:43.160
when a person can confront loss calmly

04:44.570 --> 04:47.280
and have learned to accept the reality,

04:49.370 --> 04:51.130
his youth

04:52.440 --> 04:54.280
begins to fade.

05:41.600 --> 05:42.970
I'm sorry, sir.

05:43.320 --> 05:44.480
I didn't do well on the exam.

05:44.850 --> 05:46.760
You're not sorry for me.

05:47.200 --> 05:48.970
You should be sorry for yourself.

05:53.690 --> 05:56.160
These are the ones you can usually answer correctly.

05:56.370 --> 05:58.040
How could  you make it all wrong?

05:59.370 --> 05:59.760
That is it.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.720
Go and think it over

06:02.250 --> 06:04.370
Change your seat. Put more efforts on study.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.370
Really?

06:17.600 --> 06:18.970
Did you really fail the exam?

06:19.570 --> 06:21.690
I was too nervous, so I didn't do well on the exam.

06:23.760 --> 06:24.760
All right. Let's change seats.

06:45.200 --> 06:46.200
What's going on?

06:48.970 --> 06:49.930
I sit here?

06:51.200 --> 06:52.040
All right.

06:58.280 --> 06:59.200
I'm fine.

07:17.480 --> 07:18.320
Please pass them on.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.880
On this set of papers are the classic questions from previous years.

07:24.370 --> 07:25.480
Please finish it today.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.600
I'll explain it tomorrow.

07:27.250 --> 07:28.650
Please take it seriously.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.480
An extra point is gained

07:30.970 --> 07:32.530
by getting one more question right.

07:34.089 --> 07:35.410
Please take care

07:35.410 --> 07:36.410
on your way home.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.570
Parents' company is highly recommended.

07:38.810 --> 07:40.000
If your parents can't come,

07:40.160 --> 07:41.530
please go home in groups.

07:42.200 --> 07:43.250
Class's over.

07:55.320 --> 07:56.250
Siyue

07:56.720 --> 07:59.440
Have you ever heard of Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School?

08:00.089 --> 08:01.410
Let me tell you, my friend's brother

08:01.570 --> 08:02.570
was robbed the other day.

08:02.930 --> 08:04.650
That man bullies even children.

08:05.370 --> 08:06.690
It's really scary.

08:11.530 --> 08:12.440
Don't go.

08:12.600 --> 08:13.280
Wait for me.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.930
Don't you go after him?

08:21.000 --> 08:23.130
I don't know what to say to him.

08:23.720 --> 08:26.410
It doesn't matter, just tell the truth.

08:27.370 --> 08:30.090
I'm afraid he'll go tell my aunt if I tell him.

08:30.880 --> 08:33.370
So you're going to stay like this?

08:38.210 --> 08:39.280
So you must help me think of

08:39.450 --> 08:40.839
a good excuse to change the seat.

08:44.810 --> 08:46.040
It's easy.

08:46.370 --> 08:48.400
Just say you can't see the blackboard clearly.

08:49.520 --> 08:52.250
My mom just got me a new pair of glasses.

08:52.810 --> 08:54.720
Just say you're afraid of affecting Zhou Siyue's study.

08:55.450 --> 08:56.600
Frankly speaking,

08:57.080 --> 08:59.330
Song Ziqi affects his study more than me.

09:00.160 --> 09:01.400
Or,

09:01.640 --> 09:03.520
you can say you wanna sit with Kong Shadi.

09:05.080 --> 09:07.330
He certainly won't believe such excuses.

09:08.690 --> 09:10.160
I'm at my wit's end, sorry...

09:16.450 --> 09:17.520
Zhou Siyue

09:19.890 --> 09:22.010
Zhou Siyue is coming.

09:27.250 --> 09:29.160
Didn't he go back?

09:30.960 --> 09:32.010
What a coincidence.

09:32.160 --> 09:33.480
You can't see me.

09:33.690 --> 09:34.810
Order so much delicious food.

09:35.960 --> 09:37.010
Don't order.

09:37.210 --> 09:38.280
Let's sponge.

09:39.690 --> 09:40.480
Please.

10:04.690 --> 10:05.890
It occurs to me that

10:06.130 --> 10:07.960
I have an art class to attend.

10:08.370 --> 10:09.450
I gotta run.

10:10.480 --> 10:12.520
Liar, you don't have any classes at all.

10:12.770 --> 10:14.130
I can't stay here anymore.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.210
Bye. I gotta run.

10:26.810 --> 10:27.810
What's wrong

10:29.770 --> 10:30.770
with you two?

10:34.400 --> 10:35.330
It's okay.

10:41.640 --> 10:42.480
All right.

10:42.840 --> 10:43.770
All right.

10:45.720 --> 10:46.640
Enjoy yourself.

11:03.770 --> 11:05.010
Why do you walk so fast?

11:07.210 --> 11:08.640
The teacher said we should

11:08.840 --> 11:10.720
go home quickly after school.

11:11.520 --> 11:14.570
It'll be terrible if we run into Evil Dragon.

11:18.810 --> 11:20.600
Is there nothing you wanna tell me?

11:24.040 --> 11:25.080
Why did you change the seat?

11:28.130 --> 11:29.810
I'm not in good shape this time.

11:30.640 --> 11:32.640
I'll definitely do well in the exam next time.

11:33.480 --> 11:35.890
Can I not change the seat?

11:36.770 --> 11:37.770
Sure.

11:38.520 --> 11:40.130
Let Zhou Siyue come to me.

11:44.010 --> 11:45.960
He has helped you so many times anyway.

11:46.250 --> 11:47.370
So he can help you this time.

12:00.890 --> 12:01.770
Forget it.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.080
Let's go home.

12:33.330 --> 12:35.010
Why do girls suddenly alienate someone?

12:36.520 --> 12:38.080
It means you make her angry.

12:38.930 --> 12:39.930
Who?

12:41.890 --> 12:43.960
But I have no idea what I did wrong.

12:46.770 --> 12:48.930
Girls are angry for no reason.

12:48.930 --> 12:50.370
Kong Shadi is an example.

12:52.210 --> 12:53.160
Who?

12:54.960 --> 12:56.280
So what should I do?

12:56.930 --> 12:58.210
It's easy to make girls happy.

12:58.370 --> 12:59.210
Give her a present.

13:08.370 --> 13:09.640
Who the hell is that?

13:15.930 --> 13:18.330
He hasn't spoken to me all day.

13:18.720 --> 13:20.570
You haven't talked to him either.

13:22.130 --> 13:24.040
I didn't because I didn't find a proper chance.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.040
If you don't talk to him,

13:28.720 --> 13:30.640
someone will.

13:33.600 --> 13:34.480
Why is Yang Chunzi

13:34.640 --> 13:36.330
so close to Siyue?

13:37.250 --> 13:38.520
Haven't you heard that

13:38.720 --> 13:39.450
the boy who is close to her

13:39.450 --> 13:40.770
has gone abroad?

13:41.600 --> 13:43.010
So she starts going to Siyue again.

13:43.810 --> 13:44.960
She always chops and changes.

13:45.330 --> 13:45.960
Cut it out.

13:46.810 --> 13:48.130
Stop taking up the cudgel for her.

13:48.450 --> 13:49.960
Ding Xian hasn't spoken yet.

13:51.570 --> 13:52.330
It seems that my change of seat

13:52.480 --> 13:54.080
has no effect on him.

13:55.600 --> 13:57.130
It's me who flatter myself.

13:58.010 --> 13:59.570
You're jealous.

13:59.890 --> 14:00.810
Go persuade her.

14:01.330 --> 14:02.330
One track-minded

14:09.520 --> 14:11.400
Song Ziqi, why do you drink my milk tea?

14:12.040 --> 14:13.400
Terrible taste. Save it for yourself

14:13.570 --> 14:14.600
Have I begged you to drink?

14:19.810 --> 14:21.450
What happened to Ding Xian? so lost

14:26.330 --> 14:27.450
Come on, nothing serious

14:29.770 --> 14:31.040
Come on.

14:33.250 --> 14:35.810
Can you hear what they're saying?

14:38.450 --> 14:39.810
Hurry, use your pigsney to read

14:39.960 --> 14:40.960
what they are saying.

14:41.960 --> 14:43.770
Three strings of fish balls or nothing.

14:43.960 --> 14:45.330
How dare you fish in troubled water.

14:45.520 --> 14:46.370
Four strings.

14:46.520 --> 14:47.400
My treat.

14:47.640 --> 14:48.570
Deal.

14:52.600 --> 14:54.400
Have you chosen the play yet?

14:56.330 --> 14:58.010
They are going to see a play together?

15:00.400 --> 15:01.600
I've already booked it.

15:02.370 --> 15:04.330
I'll use the computer to send it to you later.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.690
He said they weren't friends.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.130
Liar.

15:07.330 --> 15:08.520
Crows are all back.

15:10.930 --> 15:14.080
I also think something is wrong with Siyue recently.

15:14.480 --> 15:16.930
We discussed it in the group yesterday.

15:18.250 --> 15:21.250
Zhou Siyue, you said you didn't know her well.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.640
Then why do you go to the play together?

15:24.810 --> 15:26.520
I'll study hard from now on.

15:26.690 --> 15:28.400
I'll never talk to you again.

15:45.810 --> 15:47.010
Why are you so angry?

15:49.130 --> 15:50.040
I heard that

15:51.400 --> 15:54.210
a new play has been staged in Binhe Theatre recently.

15:54.600 --> 15:56.600
It's called Secret Love In Peach Blossom Land.

15:56.810 --> 15:58.040
seems quite good.

15:59.810 --> 16:01.210
You like watching plays?

16:03.250 --> 16:05.210
I just got to know it casually.

16:07.280 --> 16:09.690
Don't you like it?

16:10.840 --> 16:12.400
I haven't seen a play.

16:16.330 --> 16:17.250
But

16:19.040 --> 16:21.280
I can learn about it.

16:23.930 --> 16:25.130
I just knew it.

16:30.450 --> 16:31.840
She wants to date me.

16:35.080 --> 16:36.450
I'm back.

16:36.690 --> 16:37.890
Xianxian is back.

16:38.080 --> 16:39.160
Hurry up cleaning.

16:39.280 --> 16:40.400
Let's go to Siyue's house.

16:40.570 --> 16:43.010
His parents are back from a business trip.

16:43.370 --> 16:45.450
Enjoy yourself and leave me alone.

16:46.400 --> 16:47.770
Then no dinner for you.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.160
I'm not hungry.

17:02.210 --> 17:04.400
Mom, you look great in this makeup today.

17:04.600 --> 17:05.610
You are also beautiful without makeup.

17:05.810 --> 17:07.450
You look even better with makeup on.

17:09.730 --> 17:10.930
What do you want?

17:12.759 --> 17:13.730
Umm...

17:14.640 --> 17:15.640
Pocket money...

17:20.850 --> 17:22.039
Here you are.

17:24.810 --> 17:27.240
Mom, can you give me more?

17:29.330 --> 17:30.240
Ding Juncong

17:30.610 --> 17:32.090
Multiple times this month already

17:33.450 --> 17:34.360
Just five yuan.

17:34.610 --> 17:35.810
Not a penny more

17:42.040 --> 17:43.400
Ding Wencheng, hurry up.

17:43.810 --> 17:44.730
I'm coming.

17:46.120 --> 17:47.210
Let's go, Ding Juncong.

17:47.730 --> 17:49.330
Okay, one second.

17:49.520 --> 17:50.570
Hurry up.

17:53.570 --> 17:56.400
Sister, you look so good today.

17:57.690 --> 17:58.730
Don't even think about it.

17:58.970 --> 18:00.120
Mom's right.

18:00.330 --> 18:01.040
You should get rid of

18:01.240 --> 18:03.040
the habit of wasting pocket money.

18:03.210 --> 18:04.610
I wouldn't squander.

18:04.760 --> 18:05.690
I'm going to give...

18:08.090 --> 18:09.000
Forget it.

18:09.210 --> 18:10.400
Even if I tell you, you don't understand.

18:12.210 --> 18:13.120
What?

18:13.280 --> 18:14.640
You just resort to sophistry.

18:20.690 --> 18:21.360
By the way.

18:21.520 --> 18:23.810
Why didn't Xianxian come?

18:24.040 --> 18:24.930
She

18:25.400 --> 18:27.120
didn't do well in the monthly exam, so she studies at home.

18:27.330 --> 18:28.330
She really worries me.

18:28.610 --> 18:29.850
It happens

18:29.850 --> 18:31.210
to fail in the exam.

18:31.490 --> 18:33.520
Everyone makes mistakes.

18:34.760 --> 18:35.610
Xianxian

18:35.640 --> 18:36.760
is different from Siyue,

18:36.930 --> 18:38.160
who is very clever and learns faster.

18:38.360 --> 18:39.930
See? He knows high technology things.

18:41.930 --> 18:44.730
And Xianxian has become self-willed now,

18:45.120 --> 18:46.450
Wanting to choose sciences.

18:47.810 --> 18:50.120
Her score has deteriorated.

18:50.490 --> 18:52.120
It'll be nice if she can get enrolled by a second-tier university.

18:52.520 --> 18:53.930
We don't expect more

18:54.120 --> 18:55.210
out of her.

18:57.160 --> 18:57.850
Auntie

18:58.880 --> 18:59.760
In fact,

19:00.160 --> 19:01.850
Ding Xian's character is like this.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.930
As long as she sets her mind on a thing,

19:04.120 --> 19:05.330
she will stick to the end.

19:05.690 --> 19:07.880
So even if it's difficult to be admitted to a key university,

19:08.120 --> 19:09.520
I believe she can do it.

19:10.330 --> 19:11.730
You don't have to worry.

19:14.610 --> 19:17.090
Xianxian is a promising girl.

19:17.280 --> 19:18.400
Don't worry.

19:19.450 --> 19:20.160
Well.

19:25.810 --> 19:26.760
Ding Xian

19:28.640 --> 19:29.610
I've got a new information.

19:30.040 --> 19:30.970
Would you like to listen?

19:31.160 --> 19:31.930
I'm too lazy

19:32.000 --> 19:33.730
to listen to girls' gossip. Bye.

19:33.930 --> 19:35.810
It's about Zhou Siyue and Yang Chunzi.

19:37.610 --> 19:38.570
It's okay to listen.

19:41.160 --> 19:42.400
They once participated in a math competition together

19:42.850 --> 19:44.360
in junior high school.

19:45.000 --> 19:47.450
But gradually the rumors came.

19:47.930 --> 19:49.610
In order to avoid suspicion,

19:50.450 --> 19:52.330
Zhou Siyue estranged from Yang Chunzi.

19:53.330 --> 19:54.490
Let it be.

19:55.570 --> 19:57.090
I don't care about him and Yang Chunzi.

19:58.330 --> 19:59.400
From now on, I'll study hard

19:59.610 --> 20:00.570
and no more Zhou Siyue.

20:01.210 --> 20:02.570
Don't disturb me.

20:04.000 --> 20:04.810
Oh no.

20:05.000 --> 20:06.360
Oh no.

20:06.520 --> 20:07.400
Another one being possessed.

20:07.520 --> 20:09.640
Siyue, here.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.090
Wrong again.

20:38.930 --> 20:39.930
Song Ziqi

20:40.120 --> 20:41.160
Do you have an eraser?

20:41.640 --> 20:42.570
No, I don't

20:54.850 --> 20:55.730
Thank you.

20:56.570 --> 20:57.360
You're welcome.

21:06.280 --> 21:07.730
What are you going to do this weekend?

21:08.160 --> 21:08.930
Have fun of course.

21:09.520 --> 21:11.120
A new game center has opened nearby.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.280
It's so much fun. Let's go together.

21:14.640 --> 21:15.760
What happened to your eyes?

21:19.490 --> 21:20.850
What about you, Xianxian?

21:21.280 --> 21:22.640
I may study at home.

21:22.850 --> 21:24.570
I don't know if my mother will let me out.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.330
What about you, Siyue?

21:29.610 --> 21:30.570
We'll see.

21:34.810 --> 21:36.210
Song Ziqi, come out.

21:36.490 --> 21:37.360
Why?

21:37.520 --> 21:38.240
Hurry up.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.690
Kong Shadi, what the hell do you want?

21:47.520 --> 21:48.210
I can't stand it.

21:48.210 --> 21:49.850
I can't stand it either. Do I provoke you?

21:50.160 --> 21:51.970
Not you.

21:59.690 --> 22:01.400
There is something wrong with them.

22:01.610 --> 22:02.810
I can't let it go on this way

22:03.360 --> 22:04.120
As long as they don't get along,

22:04.240 --> 22:05.760
we won't live a happy day,

22:06.400 --> 22:08.210
right?

22:10.280 --> 22:11.210
Right.

22:12.040 --> 22:12.930
What should we do?

22:14.040 --> 22:15.160
Listen.

22:15.640 --> 22:17.240
Let's get them out this weekend

22:17.490 --> 22:19.040
and leave them alone.

22:19.970 --> 22:21.240
I'm in charge of Ding Xian.

22:21.400 --> 22:22.760
You're in charge of Siyue.

22:23.280 --> 22:25.160
Why Siyue?

22:25.210 --> 22:27.040
I don't care how you will do it, just do it well

22:27.240 --> 22:28.240
don't come to me anymore if you failed

22:29.690 --> 22:31.640
Kong Shadi

22:32.000 --> 22:33.090
what about our brotherhood you mentioned?

22:33.280 --> 22:34.360
You betray me

22:34.360 --> 22:35.240
for Ding Xian.

22:35.490 --> 22:37.090
We're not friends.

22:37.240 --> 22:38.210
Idiot.

22:38.970 --> 22:40.280
Or what?

22:40.760 --> 22:41.880
Think for yourself.

22:47.810 --> 22:48.850
Kong Shadi

22:49.640 --> 22:50.690
You wanna

22:51.400 --> 22:53.090
be my girlfriend?

22:53.240 --> 22:54.730
Don't be narcissistic, okay?

22:56.570 --> 22:57.520
You're disgusting.

23:06.730 --> 23:07.570
Xianxian

23:09.850 --> 23:10.760
Shasha

23:11.450 --> 23:12.760
What will you do this weekend? Let's hang out.

23:13.520 --> 23:16.330
Weekend? My mother won't let me go out.

23:16.640 --> 23:18.000
Oh no. It's been a long time

23:18.160 --> 23:19.400
since we hung out.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.000
And let me show you.

23:27.810 --> 23:29.090
Where did you get this ticket?

23:29.330 --> 23:30.210
My dad's company.

23:30.360 --> 23:31.210
He doesn't need this.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.240
We need.

23:36.090 --> 23:36.640
Forget it.

23:36.810 --> 23:39.240
My mother will definitely not agree.

23:39.400 --> 23:41.400
Why don't you go with Song Ziqi?

23:41.570 --> 23:43.360
No, I just wanna go with you.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.760
It's up to you.

23:46.570 --> 23:47.520
Come on

23:47.760 --> 23:49.520
Remember to dress up beautifully.

23:55.360 --> 23:56.120
What are you doing?

23:56.330 --> 23:57.490
How is the thing going?

23:57.730 --> 23:58.880
You can always count on me

23:59.610 --> 24:00.640
Really?

24:00.640 --> 24:01.490
Sure thing.

24:03.690 --> 24:05.400
-Why are you here?  -Just you two?

24:05.970 --> 24:06.850
What about Siyue?

24:08.360 --> 24:09.930
Is he still angry with me?

24:10.120 --> 24:11.450
Don't flatter yourself.

24:13.400 --> 24:14.360
Why are you here?

24:15.240 --> 24:16.520
Call for help

24:17.240 --> 24:18.520
I run out of my money.

24:18.850 --> 24:20.690
Your dad deducted your pocket money again?

24:21.850 --> 24:23.690
Soon after I get my lucky money at the end of the year,

24:23.850 --> 24:24.850
I'll pay you back.

24:25.570 --> 24:26.810
Double back

24:27.040 --> 24:28.400
Shadi, you are so kind to me.

24:29.810 --> 24:30.810
Here you are.

24:36.330 --> 24:37.090
I...

24:40.850 --> 24:41.730
I...

24:44.760 --> 24:45.970
I don't have much money.

24:46.240 --> 24:47.640
Spin out

24:48.000 --> 24:50.330
I saw a 100 yuan there just now.

24:51.760 --> 24:52.690
No.

24:56.690 --> 24:58.120
You're robbing me.

24:58.850 --> 25:01.280
Who the hell are you? robbing my friend?

25:02.400 --> 25:03.570
I didn't.

25:03.730 --> 25:04.760
Cut the crap

25:06.000 --> 25:07.240
You're Little Loach in Shen Hai High School

25:07.330 --> 25:09.120
who likes to rob nearby, right?

25:09.120 --> 25:10.570
That's Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School.

25:11.450 --> 25:12.760
Came clean? Good

25:12.970 --> 25:14.850
That's you. I'll call the police now.

25:15.090 --> 25:16.640
Don't do it. He is one of us.

25:17.360 --> 25:18.400
Let me introduce.

25:18.610 --> 25:19.610
This is my friend Jiang Chen.

25:19.760 --> 25:21.040
He is the school bully of No.18 Middle School.

25:21.210 --> 25:22.160
Who is she?

25:23.330 --> 25:25.640
I'm You Keke, the school babe of Shen Hai High School.

25:25.880 --> 25:27.760
I know you.

25:28.360 --> 25:29.000
You always

25:29.160 --> 25:31.000
hang out with the boys at our school.

25:31.360 --> 25:32.400
Don't talk nonsense.

25:32.730 --> 25:33.930
The boys in your No.18 Middle School

25:34.120 --> 25:35.360
are all jerks.

25:35.520 --> 25:37.360
Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School is from your school.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.280
What if it's not?

25:39.490 --> 25:40.450
Impossible.

25:40.610 --> 25:41.450
All right.

25:41.930 --> 25:43.330
Let's find him out.

25:43.690 --> 25:45.450
I must let you know that

25:45.610 --> 25:48.490
the boys of No.18 Middle School are innocent.

25:48.640 --> 25:50.730
All right. I'm not afraid of you.

25:50.880 --> 25:51.610
Let's go then.

25:51.760 --> 25:52.760
Go now.

25:53.810 --> 25:54.930
Why do I feel like

25:55.090 --> 25:56.570
we're both redundant?

26:02.640 --> 26:04.690
Are you still studying the unreliable horoscope and fortune?

26:05.210 --> 26:06.160
Don't talk nonsense.

26:06.570 --> 26:07.810
This is very reliable.

26:08.730 --> 26:09.880
That's what little girls would believe.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.490
superstitious

26:12.640 --> 26:13.640
You don't believe it?

26:14.160 --> 26:15.240
I'll show you,

26:15.640 --> 26:16.760
and you will know whether it is reliable or not.

26:17.570 --> 26:19.210
All right. Go ahead

26:19.360 --> 26:20.760
I just can’t wait to hear more

26:26.330 --> 26:27.160
Umm...

26:27.490 --> 26:28.490
What's the matter?

26:29.490 --> 26:31.090
What's your zodiac sign?

26:33.240 --> 26:33.570
Kong Shadi

26:33.570 --> 26:35.360
We grew up together, and

26:35.570 --> 26:37.000
You don't know my zodiac sign?

26:37.360 --> 26:39.040
Should I have to mind everything about you?

26:42.090 --> 26:43.090
Give it to me.

26:43.490 --> 26:44.280
I'll read it for myself.

26:44.450 --> 26:45.850
I'm an Aquarius. Please remember that.

26:46.730 --> 26:48.160
Aquarius, here.

26:48.730 --> 26:51.760
Aquarius should reduce travel this week

26:51.970 --> 26:55.640
in case of losing money and red ruins...

26:57.000 --> 26:58.360
Nonsense.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.810
You're screwed, Song Ziqi.

27:00.000 --> 27:03.280
Loss of money and a fatal disaster.

27:04.240 --> 27:05.280
Shut up.

27:11.640 --> 27:12.610
Ding Wencheng

27:13.360 --> 27:14.280
Wake up, please.

27:14.850 --> 27:15.760
What's up?

27:17.280 --> 27:18.160
Look.

27:18.640 --> 27:19.570
What?

27:19.970 --> 27:21.040
Cinema tickets.

27:22.810 --> 27:24.570
How strange.

27:25.360 --> 27:26.570
It's been more than ten years

27:26.760 --> 27:28.210
since we last saw a movie.

27:28.570 --> 27:29.730
Why did you suddenly buy movie tickets?

27:29.880 --> 27:30.850
They're not for you.

27:31.490 --> 27:32.610
They're for Xianxian.

27:32.810 --> 27:34.400
You let her go with her friends.

27:34.610 --> 27:35.850
And together

27:36.090 --> 27:37.880
with this dress to her.

27:40.490 --> 27:41.640
You figured it out?

27:42.970 --> 27:44.210
You started it

27:44.360 --> 27:46.040
Go fix it by yourself. I won't go.

27:47.280 --> 27:48.360
You such a guy!

27:48.520 --> 27:50.000
Why is it so difficult to count on you?

27:50.210 --> 27:51.850
This is your business.

27:52.040 --> 27:53.610
If I give them to Xianxian,

27:53.810 --> 27:54.520
should I do it in your name

27:54.690 --> 27:55.810
or in my name?

27:58.160 --> 27:59.090
I'll go

28:11.400 --> 28:12.330
Mom

28:13.640 --> 28:14.730
What's up?

28:16.400 --> 28:17.640
You're going out?

28:18.570 --> 28:21.160
Shadi asks me to a concert.

28:21.450 --> 28:23.520
I have no choice

28:23.690 --> 28:24.760
but to say yes.

28:26.330 --> 28:27.120
Umm...

28:27.880 --> 28:30.690
Mom, can I go?

28:31.490 --> 28:32.610
Yes.

28:33.240 --> 28:34.240
Thank you, mom.

28:37.730 --> 28:39.120
You're gonna wear this?

28:39.730 --> 28:41.160
I haven't made up my mind.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.040
Umm...

28:45.690 --> 28:47.450
I bought you a dress.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.450
Take it

28:53.640 --> 28:54.360
Mom

28:54.850 --> 28:55.610
I

28:56.640 --> 28:59.210
don't do anything wrong, right?

28:59.400 --> 29:00.280
Oh no, poor thing.

29:00.520 --> 29:01.930
Can't I be nicer to you?

29:02.330 --> 29:03.120
Take this.

29:16.240 --> 29:17.120
500 yuan.

29:20.520 --> 29:21.330
300 yuan.

29:21.850 --> 29:23.360
Mom, this is too expensive.

29:23.520 --> 29:24.970
You better return it.

29:25.160 --> 29:26.330
Just put it on

29:29.090 --> 29:29.930
Enjoy yourself.

29:30.450 --> 29:31.520
Remember to come back early.

29:32.240 --> 29:33.810
Remember to answer my call

29:37.400 --> 29:38.330
Thank you, mom.

30:04.880 --> 30:05.810
You scared me.

30:06.000 --> 30:06.760
What's the matter?

30:08.090 --> 30:09.330
You come out in this?

30:09.640 --> 30:10.810
So what?

30:10.970 --> 30:12.970
The important thing is not to be discovered, correct?

30:14.280 --> 30:15.360
Do I look handsome in it.

30:22.610 --> 30:24.040
Hello, Shadi, where are you?

30:24.520 --> 30:25.330
I'm on my way.

30:25.520 --> 30:26.120
I'll be there in a minute.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.450
I'll hang up first, bye.

30:30.090 --> 30:31.240
Hang up so fast.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.810
Is Zhou Siyue here or not?

30:34.160 --> 30:35.760
I don't know. I already told him.

30:35.760 --> 30:36.850
Zhou Siyue

30:47.360 --> 30:48.610
What are you doing?

30:49.000 --> 30:50.000
If I don't do this,

30:50.000 --> 30:51.120
I'm afraid he would see me.

31:08.000 --> 31:09.360
Why are you here?

31:12.040 --> 31:13.090
I come to the concert.

31:23.210 --> 31:24.400
They went in.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.730
How did you ask Zhou Siyue out?

31:27.930 --> 31:29.970
It's very simple. I said Ding Xian would go too,

31:29.970 --> 31:32.120
and then here he is. I'm great, right?

31:33.760 --> 31:35.570
Done, mission completed.

31:35.850 --> 31:36.690
Retreat

31:37.520 --> 31:38.610
Wait.

31:39.520 --> 31:41.690
My dad gave me four tickets.

31:44.880 --> 31:45.970
Thanks, dad.

31:46.760 --> 31:47.810
You're welcome.

31:48.760 --> 31:49.810
Let's go.

32:09.610 --> 32:10.520
You're shoving me.

32:12.330 --> 32:13.120
What's up?

32:14.330 --> 32:15.850
Nothing serious. I just sprained my ankle.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.930
Take a sit

32:24.850 --> 32:25.730
Let me have a look.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.210
This foot?

32:27.640 --> 32:30.450
It's okay. I just need a break.

32:45.040 --> 32:45.970
I felt that

32:48.000 --> 32:49.850
you don't like talking.

32:54.760 --> 32:57.360
I was born this way.

32:59.520 --> 33:00.640
I don't know how to refuse

33:01.160 --> 33:02.730
I dare not ask favors.

33:03.570 --> 33:06.520
worrying too much most of the time

33:07.090 --> 33:08.810
Even with words on the tip of my tongue,

33:09.970 --> 33:11.360
I swallowed it

33:17.450 --> 33:18.690
You don't have to worry.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.330
We're friends.

33:29.880 --> 33:30.970
Friends

33:31.330 --> 33:32.970
should help

33:33.120 --> 33:34.120
each other.

33:35.880 --> 33:38.690
But I always give you trouble.

33:39.570 --> 33:42.610
No one in this world

33:42.760 --> 33:44.450
can do everything perfectly.

33:45.160 --> 33:45.760
What's more,

33:45.760 --> 33:47.520
I don't feel being troubled at all.

33:57.330 --> 33:58.850
Can you tell me

33:59.880 --> 34:01.760
what happened to you now?

34:05.880 --> 34:06.730
Actually,

34:07.450 --> 34:09.770
The Aunt came to me some time ago.

34:10.319 --> 34:11.250
said

34:11.930 --> 34:13.800
someone reported that we got along too close.

34:13.970 --> 34:14.970
He asked me to change my seat.

34:15.490 --> 34:16.770
I promised him that

34:17.120 --> 34:18.730
as long as the score of this monthly exam was improved,

34:18.930 --> 34:20.080
I wouldn't have to change my seat.

34:21.970 --> 34:22.800
But

34:24.160 --> 34:25.530
I didn't do well in the exam.

34:27.359 --> 34:29.120
Just because of this petty thing,

34:31.640 --> 34:33.359
you concocted excuses and lied to me?

34:34.770 --> 34:35.640
No.

34:36.250 --> 34:39.050
The Aunt said that every time something happened to me,

34:39.210 --> 34:40.930
you helped me.

34:41.800 --> 34:43.930
I don't want to get you into trouble

34:44.490 --> 34:45.839
because of my own businesses anymore.

34:47.450 --> 34:48.970
Luckily, you're not mad at me.

34:50.640 --> 34:52.250
What?

34:52.450 --> 34:53.319
It doesn't matter.

34:54.530 --> 34:55.490
In short,

34:56.450 --> 34:58.360
you just need to study hard in the future.

34:58.930 --> 35:00.560
Leave the rest to me.

35:02.050 --> 35:03.120
Starting from tomorrow,

35:03.530 --> 35:05.250
I will tutor you alone.

35:05.690 --> 35:07.400
I don't believe you can fail again in the exam.

35:23.970 --> 35:24.930
What are you doing?

35:25.690 --> 35:26.640
Look, how well I am disguised myself

35:27.970 --> 35:29.080
Perfectly fit into environment

35:33.490 --> 35:34.690
There is something wrong with me.

35:35.250 --> 35:36.600
I can't believe I didn't hang out on weekends,

35:36.880 --> 35:38.250
but accompany you here to wait for blackmailers

35:38.400 --> 35:39.400
and endure the cold wind.

35:39.690 --> 35:40.560
I'm leaving.

35:41.010 --> 35:41.930
Bye.

35:44.360 --> 35:45.400
You don't even try detaining me?

35:47.050 --> 35:48.250
I think you're right.

35:48.800 --> 35:49.800
You can leave now.

35:50.490 --> 35:51.560
I'll wait here.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.050
Nobody asked you out?

35:55.880 --> 35:57.210
Who dares

35:57.800 --> 36:00.560
Right, no one dares to ask you out.

36:02.290 --> 36:03.450
You are smarter than me.

36:03.730 --> 36:05.770
Otherwise, we both can't even catch a taxi.

36:06.250 --> 36:07.290
Of course.

36:07.530 --> 36:10.010
I consulted today's fortune before departure.

36:10.250 --> 36:13.600
It says I'd better walk today

36:14.290 --> 36:16.530
and fortune awaits

36:16.800 --> 36:17.880
It's all a coincidence.

36:18.160 --> 36:19.880
It also says that I'll have a fatal disaster.

36:20.050 --> 36:21.120
But this week is coming to an end,

36:21.290 --> 36:22.320
and I am still fine.

36:24.120 --> 36:25.930
No one shows up for so long.

36:26.530 --> 36:27.770
Is your bro countable?

36:28.360 --> 36:29.490
Or...

36:31.250 --> 36:32.320
What are you doing?

36:33.490 --> 36:34.450
There are people here.

36:42.290 --> 36:43.640
Does it cool down at night?

36:43.800 --> 36:44.690
I'm so cold.

36:45.450 --> 36:47.320
Here they come.

36:48.120 --> 36:50.970
Let me give you some warmth?

36:51.160 --> 36:53.560
What are you doing? You're so cheesy.

36:53.880 --> 36:54.640
Where to go?

36:54.640 --> 36:55.450
Go to the bathroom.

36:55.640 --> 36:57.050
Don't follow me, psycho.

36:57.450 --> 36:58.800
Rogue.

36:59.160 --> 37:00.530
He's also very lecherous.

37:01.730 --> 37:02.560
You stay here.

37:02.730 --> 37:03.690
I'll go meet him.

37:04.290 --> 37:05.560
If anything bad happens, call the police immediately.

37:11.010 --> 37:11.970
Psycho?

37:12.160 --> 37:13.080
I'm a psycho?

37:13.450 --> 37:15.770
I think I look handsome in this coat.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.450
Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School

37:23.010 --> 37:24.320
You really don't need me to carry you?

37:26.530 --> 37:27.800
My sprain has recovered a lot.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.290
Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School

37:31.560 --> 37:32.640
I must give you a piece of my mind.

37:35.490 --> 37:37.010
The voice sounds so familiar.

37:37.880 --> 37:39.490
It seems to be Jiang Chen's voice.

37:40.800 --> 37:41.880
Wait here for a minute.

37:42.160 --> 37:43.120
Let me take a look.

37:52.490 --> 37:53.210
There you are.

37:53.400 --> 37:54.290
He is Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School.

37:54.730 --> 37:55.840
I must beat him up.

38:01.530 --> 38:01.880
Don't hit me.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.210
You're Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School.

38:08.210 --> 38:08.930
What are you doing?

38:09.080 --> 38:10.400
He is Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School. Hit him.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.320
He is Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School?

38:13.080 --> 38:14.800
Hit him.

38:15.600 --> 38:16.250
Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School

38:16.250 --> 38:17.640
Hit him.

38:17.770 --> 38:18.840
Kong Shadi

38:19.490 --> 38:21.530
He also knows my name is Kong Shadi?

38:21.770 --> 38:22.770
Hit him.

38:22.930 --> 38:24.210
Kong Shadi

38:24.560 --> 38:25.800
You're stupid. It's me.

38:26.080 --> 38:27.690
Kong Shadi

38:27.690 --> 38:28.360
No.

38:28.690 --> 38:29.770
Wait.

38:30.400 --> 38:32.400
Why does his voice sound so familiar to me?

38:32.880 --> 38:33.840
Who?

38:43.290 --> 38:46.490
It turns out that I had fatal disaster.

39:00.010 --> 39:01.010
Jiang Chen is to blame

39:01.730 --> 39:03.010
for this today.

39:04.880 --> 39:06.800
He told me about Evil Dragon when I came over.

39:08.450 --> 39:09.600
You apologize to him.

39:09.930 --> 39:10.770
Please have some food.

39:10.930 --> 39:11.800
Don't touch me.

39:16.210 --> 39:17.320
Don't touch me.

39:18.450 --> 39:19.600
Are you a sore loser?

39:21.160 --> 39:22.730
Let me beat you up?

39:25.490 --> 39:26.840
All right.

39:27.450 --> 39:30.120
I admit that

39:30.400 --> 39:32.210
we both did something wrong today.

39:34.450 --> 39:35.770
All right. Just cry.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.400
Everything will be fine after you cry.

39:44.210 --> 39:45.160
Here you are.

39:45.770 --> 39:47.050
This works very well.

39:53.320 --> 39:54.360
Ding Xian

39:55.490 --> 39:57.450
It's OK if they are both bad.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.600
Even you've gone bad.

40:00.800 --> 40:03.010
I just got hurt too.

40:03.210 --> 40:05.730
Can you compare your injury with my injury?

40:05.930 --> 40:09.120
I suffered both mental and physical injuries.

40:09.360 --> 40:11.360
I didn't cry either.

40:17.120 --> 40:18.320
Enough.

40:18.320 --> 40:19.250
I'm in pain.

40:20.050 --> 40:20.930
Shut up.

40:24.210 --> 40:25.010
Let go of me.

40:25.640 --> 40:26.970
I have no money.

40:28.640 --> 40:30.450
It sounds like my brother's voice.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.800
Let go of me.

40:32.690 --> 40:33.560
It's really my brother's voice.

40:33.930 --> 40:34.880
Just wait here.

40:36.840 --> 40:37.530
Hurry up.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.160
Give me the money.

40:40.970 --> 40:42.880
You are Evil Dragon in Shen Hai High School?

40:43.450 --> 40:44.530
Who are you?

40:48.530 --> 40:49.530
It's all misunderstanding.

40:49.930 --> 40:50.800
Misunderstanding?

40:51.080 --> 40:53.250
Look at my face.

40:53.530 --> 40:54.770
It's all because of you.

41:00.010 --> 41:01.250
How dare you cry.

41:05.530 --> 41:07.450
You don't even know to tell me about the blackmail?

41:07.730 --> 41:09.050
Are you stupid?

41:09.290 --> 41:10.840
I was going to tell you then.

41:11.600 --> 41:13.120
But you were particularly aggressive that day.

41:15.210 --> 41:16.880
It's your usual misbehavior to blame.

41:17.120 --> 41:18.010
You either squander pocket money

41:18.210 --> 41:19.320
or you love to talk back.

41:19.690 --> 41:20.770
So I...

41:20.930 --> 41:23.010
So it doesn't matter if I say it or not.

41:27.640 --> 41:29.120
Your brother is just like you.

41:32.160 --> 41:33.120
Brother

41:33.600 --> 41:35.490
I know you're with my sister.

41:37.970 --> 41:40.120
You're not with your sister?

41:40.320 --> 41:41.210
No.

41:41.360 --> 41:42.290
She especially hates me.

41:42.450 --> 41:43.770
She's always mean to me.

41:44.530 --> 41:45.930
How can she do this to you?

41:46.450 --> 41:47.400
I'm right, right?

41:48.600 --> 41:49.450
Look,

41:50.290 --> 41:52.210
your sister sprained her ankle,

41:52.400 --> 41:53.400
but she insisted on looking for you.

41:53.770 --> 41:54.560
After she found you,

41:54.560 --> 41:56.160
she tried to beat you angrily.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.490
Fortunately, I stopped her.

41:57.840 --> 41:59.400
She can't be so aggressive.

41:59.930 --> 42:01.930
You don't even know my sister.

42:03.530 --> 42:05.490
We're almost home. Please walk quickly.

42:06.600 --> 42:08.450
You can go home if you want to.

42:08.880 --> 42:09.880
Goodbye.

42:11.120 --> 42:12.250
Take your time.

42:20.160 --> 42:21.400
Your brother

42:24.050 --> 42:25.010
is fine.

42:28.250 --> 42:28.840
So I...

42:29.530 --> 42:30.690
Goodbye.

42:33.450 --> 42:34.400
Just give me a second.

42:54.840 --> 42:55.930
What is it?

42:57.120 --> 42:58.250
My present to you.

42:58.930 --> 43:00.600
-Painting tools.  -Painting tools.

43:02.730 --> 43:03.530
Painting tools?

43:05.490 --> 43:06.730
You're welcome.

43:08.490 --> 43:09.250
So

43:09.770 --> 43:12.930
this's why you came to Yang Chunzi last time?

43:14.600 --> 43:16.530
She has family members abroad.

43:16.770 --> 43:18.490
So I asked her to book one for me.

43:24.210 --> 43:25.210
What's the matter?

43:25.730 --> 43:29.210
It seems I misunderstood you.

43:30.120 --> 43:31.050
Misunderstood?

43:31.730 --> 43:32.730
For what?

43:38.160 --> 43:39.080
You remain silent again.

43:45.320 --> 43:46.080
All right.

